      <div class="page-section-anchor" id="heres-what-our-customers-are-saying-1169937"></div>
  
    
  <div class="page-section page-section-heres-what-our-customers-are-saying page-section-1169937 background-ultra-light-gray page-section-testimonial-slider-card gradient-light-gray-white"
      style="">
        <div class="container " style="">
                                          


<div class="page-section-headline ">
                <h2 class="page-section-title">Here's what our customers are saying:</h2>
      
  </div>
        
        
                
              
      
      
                <div class="row d-flex justify-content-center">
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    <div class="position-absolute bg-elements col-12 col-md-8 p-7">
            <span class="before-block"></span>
            <span class="after-block"></span>
          </div>
          
  <script>
    mozModules.push(["flickity"]);
  </script>


  <div id="slider-292" class="flickity testimonial-card-slider card col-12 col-md-8 p-5 p-md-7" data-flickity="{&quot;imagesLoaded&quot;:true,&quot;draggable&quot;:true,&quot;pageDots&quot;:true,&quot;prevNextButtons&quot;:true,&quot;wrapAround&quot;:true,&quot;autoPlay&quot;:5000}">
                        








    <div class="card-body">
                

<div class=" ">
          <img alt="Brian Rutledge"
         src="https://moz.com/images/assets/avatars/Brian_Rutledge.png?w=160&amp;h=160&amp;auto=compress%2Cformat&amp;fit=crop&amp;dm=1637100336&amp;s=4b6672ffb8172bc14edaeebae298e4a5"
         width="80"
         height="80"
         class="rounded-circle "
         loading="lazy">
  </div>

      <p class="h5 pt-4 mb-0 lead bold">Brian Rutledge</p>
      Founder
              at
                  <a href="https://moz.com/case-studies/www.gpo.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            GPO
          </a>
                    <p></p>
      <div class="rating d-flex justify-content-center mt-2">
          
  

  <svg class="icon large m-auto text-center icon-stars-five" >
    <use href="#icon-stars-five">
  </svg>

      </div>
      <div class="testimonial-body pt-4"><p><a href="https://moz.com/products/local"><strong>Moz Local</strong></a> helped increase our client's footprint in the local search ecosphere which ultimately led to higher brand authority in Google. Moz Local took our location data and put it in all of the right places.</p></div>
    </div>
              
                        








    <div class="card-body">
                

<div class=" ">
          <img alt="Jackie Brown"
         src="https://moz.com/images/assets/avatars/Jackie-Brown-Headshot.png?w=160&amp;h=160&amp;auto=compress%2Cformat&amp;fit=crop&amp;dm=1637345669&amp;s=18dfe74e5684e93d4c020c774a510e08"
         width="80"
         height="80"
         class="rounded-circle "
         loading="lazy">
  </div>

      <p class="h5 pt-4 mb-0 lead bold">Jackie Brown</p>
      Website Support Coordinator
              at
                  <a href="https://www.goldenproportions.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            GPM
          </a>
                    <p></p>
      <div class="rating d-flex justify-content-center mt-2">
          
  

  <svg class="icon large m-auto text-center icon-stars-five" >
    <use href="#icon-stars-five">
  </svg>

      </div>
      <div class="testimonial-body pt-4"><p>I am constantly asked by clients 'How do I rank higher on Google?' and it can be difficult to explain all that goes into that. <a href="https://moz.com/products/local"><strong>Moz Local</strong></a> helps us point to tangible improvements over time and benchmark success.</p></div>
    </div>
              
                        








    <div class="card-body">
                

<div class=" ">
          <img alt="Laura Simis"
         src="https://moz.com/images/products/avatars/Laura-Simis-Headshot.jpg?w=160&amp;h=160&amp;auto=compress%2Cformat&amp;fit=crop&amp;dm=1547061407&amp;s=7c305b15946daa2c9ec4c3550b328e18"
         width="80"
         height="80"
         class="rounded-circle "
         loading="lazy">
  </div>

      <p class="h5 pt-4 mb-0 lead bold">Laura Simis</p>
      Associate Director of Organic Strategy
              at
                  <a href="https://www.coalmarch.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            Coalmarch Productions
          </a>
                    <p></p>
      <div class="rating d-flex justify-content-center mt-2">
          
  

  <svg class="icon large m-auto text-center icon-stars-five" >
    <use href="#icon-stars-five">
  </svg>

      </div>
      <div class="testimonial-body pt-4"><p>We've been using <a href="https://moz.com/products/pro"><strong>Moz Pro</strong></a> since 2012 and it is the ONLY piece of software that makes the cut time and time again. It brings so much to the table for a smaller team that has to do a little bit of everything.</p></div>
    </div>
              
                        








    <div class="card-body">
                

<div class=" ">
          <img alt="Jason Nurmi"
         src="https://moz.com/images/assets/avatars/Jason_Nurmi_2021-11-16-220336_yuom.png?w=160&amp;h=160&amp;auto=compress%2Cformat&amp;fit=crop&amp;dm=1637100217&amp;s=eff67dc289235275d9ef4a9934e7df81"
         width="80"
         height="80"
         class="rounded-circle "
         loading="lazy">
  </div>

      <p class="h5 pt-4 mb-0 lead bold">Jason Nurmi</p>
      Marketing Manager
              at
                  <a href="https://www.zillow.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            Zillow
          </a>
                    <p></p>
      <div class="rating d-flex justify-content-center mt-2">
          
  

  <svg class="icon large m-auto text-center icon-stars-five" >
    <use href="#icon-stars-five">
  </svg>

      </div>
      <div class="testimonial-body pt-4"><p><a href="https://moz.com/products/pro"><strong>Moz Pro</strong></a> gives us the data we need to justify our projects and strategies. It helps us track the ROI of our efforts and brings significant transparency to our industry.</p></div>
    </div>
              
                        








    <div class="card-body">
                

<div class=" ">
          <img alt="Mike King"
         src="https://moz.com/images/cms/products/pro/mike_king.png?w=160&amp;h=160&amp;auto=compress%2Cformat&amp;fit=crop&amp;dm=1532382779&amp;s=ed21e5aa3d36855aa3b0364ce738655d"
         width="80"
         height="80"
         class="rounded-circle "
         loading="lazy">
  </div>

      <p class="h5 pt-4 mb-0 lead bold">Mike King</p>
      Managing Director and Founder
              at
                  <a href="https://ipullrank.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            iPullRank
          </a>
                    <p></p>
      <div class="rating d-flex justify-content-center mt-2">
          
  

  <svg class="icon large m-auto text-center icon-stars-five" >
    <use href="#icon-stars-five">
  </svg>

      </div>
      <div class="testimonial-body pt-4"><p>Of all the rank tracking tools I've used, <a href="https://moz.com/products/stat"><strong>STAT</strong></a> is the most consistently accurate and well beyond everything else.</p></div>
    </div>
              
                        








    <div class="card-body">
                

<div class=" ">
