      </div>
      <div class="testimonial-body pt-4"><p>We're big fans of <a href="https://moz.com/products/stat"><strong>STAT</strong></a> because it gives the most granular insights on a day-by-day basis. Being able to go to clients with daily feedback and super-targeted optimizations backed by metrics… that’s invaluable for us.</p></div>
